WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:04.588
[Filburt] We were floating around&nbsp;
the universe for the past 20 years.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:07.090 position:63%
[Heffer] Ooh! We're passing Earth again.

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:09.384
Push... the... button!

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.636
[buzzes]

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:13.347
[all screaming]

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.473
We're home.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.474
[all cheering]

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.060 position:63%
I don't think we're in the '90s anymore.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.686
-[siren wails]
-[grunts]

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.646
[screams]

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.772
[laughing]

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.981
-[beeping]
-[grunting]

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:25.567
I just got the new O-Phone 9.

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:26.568
[both] Ten!

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:29.154
[Filburt] It's so realistic!

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:30.280
-[bell dinging]
-[grunts]

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:33.408
The 21st century&nbsp;
is a very dangerous century.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.245
I'm gonna find some episodes&nbsp;
of The Fatheads.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:39.122
That's been off the air for years.

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:41.166
That show is all I have!

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.295
We're going on an epic quest
to find the great Ralph Bighead.

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:46.505
Let's go!

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:48.215
[laughing]

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:50.008
[laughs]

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.009
Ralphie!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.471
Why don't you go back
to the '90s where you belong?

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:55.931
[all] Yeah!

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.893
[flatulates]

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.104 position:63%
Oh, that wind came out of the wrong end.

